901 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Designer \174 Jul 2026 \055 Present\nLayr Labs\054 Hyderabad\n\nUX\057UI Design Intern \174 Nov 2025\054 7\0565 months\050Leoforce\054 Hyderabad\n\nConducted comprehensive competitive analysis and developed detailed user personas\054 information architecture \050IA\051\054 and user flows to identify and bridge feature gaps\056 while partnering closely with Senior Designers and a Product Manager\056\n\nUtilized Figma to create high\055fidelity mockups and interactive prototypes\054 incorporating multidisciplinary feedback\056\n\nFacilitated brainstorming sessions and explored emerging research methodologies to drive user\055centered additions to the core product\056\n\nDigitization Intern \174 May 2025\054 8 weeks\nTata Boeing Aerospace Ltd\056\054 Adibatla\n\nStreamlined manufacturing workflows by converting legacy aerospace drawings into high\055precision 3D digital models using CATIAv5\054 to support manufacturing and assembly of aircraft parts \050Part Design\054 Boolean operations\054 basic Generative Surface Design\051 for NC programming and digital modelling\056\n\nApplied GD\046T and engineering fits to improve manufacturability and design accuracy\056 \n\n Observed and documented key aerospace manufacturing processes\054 including sheet metal fabrication \050cutting\054 forming\054 coating\051\054 riveting\054 fastening\054 bush installation\054 CNC machining\054 rigging\054 and sealant application\056\n\nMiniature model maker \174 Feb 2025\054 8 weeks\050Deloitte\054 Hyderabad\n\nDesigned and built 1\072100 scale models of tables\054 chairs\054 counters\054 and shelves\054 including fine miniature elements like fruits and vegetables for a diorama\056 \n\nUsed Adobe Illustrator for precise layouts\054 optimized for laser cutting\054 and constructed the models using cardboard\054 MDF\054 and scrap materials\056\n\nHead of Sketch Cafe \174 Jul 2024\054 8 months\nProduct Design Club\054 Woxsen University\n\nOrganized \034Sketch Cafe\035 to create a welcoming sketching environment that encouraged participation from students across all schools\054 fostering multidisciplinary dialogue and interaction through the medium of sketching\056\n\n)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 902 0 R
